OL,3,GNEWSAParents say SEND system is failing
OL,4,Atheir children
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) have called for more specialist
OL,9,Fschool places and better support,
OL,10,Fsaying the current system is failing
OL,11,Ftheir children.
OL,13,FFamilies gathered outside
OL,14,FLeicestershire County Council's offices
OL,15,Fto share experiences of children being
OL,16,Fout of school for months, struggling to
OL,17,Faccess support and waiting for
OL,18,Fspecialist placements.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
