OL,3,GNEWSAParents say SEND system is failing
OL,4,Atheir children
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtest organiser Sharan Rodrigues, 42,
OL,7,Fsaid she took to social media after
OL,8,Frealising her family's experience
OL,9,F"wasn't an isolated case".
OL,11,FThe county council said it understood
OL,12,Fthe concerns and acknowledged that
OL,13,Fspecialist places were "not always
OL,14,Fimmediately available".
